  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It appears that the import/export tool always creates a 'predicates' config option whether or not predicates has been specified as a parameter. The default is ldp:contains.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The verification tool should probably throw an error if predicates is not found in the config rather than supplying its own default value.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
