  "description": "<p>It appears that the import/export tool always creates a 'predicates' config option whether or not predicates has been specified as a parameter. The default is ldp:contains.  </p>\n\n<p>The verification tool should probably throw an error if predicates is not found in the config rather than supplying its own default value.</p>",
